WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.229
Oh! Hello!

2
00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:06.987
Who are

3
00:00:06.988 --> 00:00:10.667
you? I'm a

4
00:00:10.668 --> 00:00:13.457
grasshopper. We are

5
00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:20.918
insects that jump! Where do

6
00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:23.109
you live? We live

7
00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:26.894
all over the world. We like

8
00:00:26.895 --> 00:00:31.376
forests and fields. What do

9
00:00:31.377 --> 00:00:34.197
you eat? Grasshoppers eat

10
00:00:34.198 --> 00:00:37.782
plants. We

11
00:00:37.783 --> 00:00:41.517
eat lots of leaves. We

12
00:00:41.518 --> 00:00:45.211
like bark and flowers too. You

13
00:00:45.212 --> 00:00:48.558
have really long legs! Our

14
00:00:48.559 --> 00:00:52.466
long back legs help us jump. We

15
00:00:52.467 --> 00:00:57.703
can jump very high and very far. Can

16
00:00:57.704 --> 00:01:00.744
you fly? Most

17
00:01:00.745 --> 00:01:07.291
grasshoppers have wings and can fly. Our

18
00:01:07.292 --> 00:01:11.702
legs help us spring into the air. Do

19
00:01:11.703 --> 00:01:14.954
you have any enemies? Many

20
00:01:14.955 --> 00:01:18.389
animals like to eat us. But

21
00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:21.181
our colors help us hide.

22
00:01:21.182 --> 00:01:24.746
We can hop away fast too!

23
00:01:24.747 --> 00:01:27.547
Do you live alone?

24
00:01:27.548 --> 00:01:30.627
Grasshoppers usually live alone.

25
00:01:30.628 --> 00:01:35.450
But sometimes we gather in big groups.

26
00:01:35.451 --> 00:01:38.538
I see some fresh grass.

27
00:01:38.539 --> 00:01:42.155
I'm going to jump over there.

28
00:01:42.156 --> 00:01:47.032
Good-bye, Grasshopper!

